WEBVTT

00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:06.550
The mover wanted me to stay on the line while I red the contract.

00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:08.841
Them: I'll wait on hold.

00:00:08.841 --> 00:00:10.125
Them: Take your time.

00:00:11.125 --> 00:00:14.050
Them: The price changes if you hang up.

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:17.525
Then, five thousand dollars down.

00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:22.389
A real mover lets you hang up, read it, and call back tomorrow.

00:00:22.389 --> 00:00:25.455
The mover I booked took a hundred dollars down.

00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:27.407
Hang up.

00:00:27.407 --> 00:00:28.294
Read it first.

00:00:28.294 --> 00:00:29.689
Packed Rabbit dot com.

00:00:29.689 --> 00:00:32.097
Plan your move without the spam calls.

00:00:32.097 --> 00:00:36.850
If this helped, like it, share it with someone who's moving, and subscribe.
